@title: quotes_mocked
@context: The quotes API answered from a file, across clicks and a second visit.
@tags: network
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Answer the API from a file
    MOCK GET "api/quotes.json" with 'mocks/quotes.json'
    NAVIGATE to 'Quotes'
    VERIFY that 'Mocked one.' is present
    VERIFY that 'Alan Kay' is NOT present

STEP 2: The next quote
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Mocked two.' is present
    VERIFY that 'Pallas' is present

STEP 3: Round to the first
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Mocked one.' is present

STEP 4: The second again
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Mocked two.' is present

STEP 5: Go home
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

STEP 6: Back to the quotes
    CLICK the 'Quote of the day' link
    VERIFY that 'Mocked one.' is present

STEP 7: Still mocked
    CLICK the 'Next quote' button
    VERIFY that 'Mocked two.' is present
    VERIFY that 'Kent Beck' is NOT present

DONE.
